'''Ortolans''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> [[elephantine]]<ref name="Holocron" /> [[species]] of squat, [[Color|blue]]-skinned bipeds with large, floppy [[ear]]s, beady black [[eye]]s, and a trunk-like [[nose]] that were [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[Temperature|cold]] [[planet]] [[Orto]]. They consumed large amounts of [[Foodstuff|food]] in order to develop a warm layer of blubber due to the frigid temperatures of their homeworld.<ref name="Alien Archive" /> [[Maximilian Rebo]], founder of the [[Max Rebo Band]], was a [[Gender|male]] Ortolan.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />

==Biology and appearance==
[[File:Azool_and_Max.png|thumb|left|250px|Maximilian Rebo and [[Azool Phantelle]], two Ortolans]]
Ortolans were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] of squat, [[Color|blue]]-skinned bipeds with trunk-like [[nose]]s and two beady black [[eye]]s.<ref name="Return of the Jedi" /> They also possessed small [[mouth]]s filled with blunted [[Tooth|teeth]] behind their [[nose]]s<ref name="Shadows and Secrets, Part IV" /> and a pair of large, floppy [[ear]]s,<ref name="Return of the Jedi" /> which were sensitive to sound<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> and used to store fat.<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> Ortolans fended off the cold of their [[Water|icy]] and snowy habitat by eating their way to a blubbery body.<ref name="VE" /> Their articulated digits were able to absorb [[Foodstuff|food]] and drink as well as play musical instruments.<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> According to [[Inspector]] [[Thanoth]], their secretions were "quite distinctive." Ortolans were capable of speaking [[Galactic Basic Standard]]<ref name="Shadows and Secrets, Part IV" /> and their average lifespan was 71+ [[Standard year|years]].<ref name="Absolutely Everything You Need to Know" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In a post on StarWars.com detailing behind the scenes for ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' "[[The High Tower]]," an Ortolan doll matching the Legends depiction is described as, "an Ortolan doll (with extra limbs)".<ref name="High Tower">{{Resistance|The High Tower}}</ref>

